        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Maximum Security Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis maximum security double cylinder deadbolt made by Schlage will fit all standard door cutouts. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. An ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt. Operated by a key on either side of the door, it is most commonly used on doors located near windows.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b60\"><b>Schlage B60 Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/commercial-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b581\"><b>Schlage B581 Commercial Grade 2 Single-Sided Deadbolt With Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/residential-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b81\"><b>Schlage B81 Residential Single Sided Deadbolt With Exposed Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/one-sided-deadbolt-schlage-b80\"><b>Schlage B80 One-Sided Deadbolt With No Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage deadbolts are bigger and stronger than they were before. They are ANSI Grade 1--the toughest ANSI grade available. Tough construction paired with innovative features that provide added control, security and peace of mind.\r\n<br>\r\nPlease see our guide on <a href=\"/pages/how-to-choose-the-best-deadbolt\">how to choose the best deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of Schlage B62 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Schlage Maximum Security Deadbolts.</li>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<Li>Has an anti-pick shield around the cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/B62-install.pdf?v=1704262173\" target=\"new\"><b>Schlage B62 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage B 62 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" Door Thickness</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 2.420\"</li>\r\n<li>Universal deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted on both the inside and the outside by a key. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Double Cylinder Maximum Security Grade 1 Deadbolt Schlage B62",
                "description": "Schlage Maximum Security Double Cylinder Deadbolt, B62 - This maximum security double cylinder deadbolt made by Schlage will fit all standard door cutouts. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. An ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt. Operated by a key on either side of the door, it is most commonly used on doors located near windows. Available in 11 finishes.",
